<title>USA: Security Capital files for 4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Security Capital files for 4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security Capital Atlantic Inc said Wednesday it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission covering 4 million common shares.</p>
<p>The company reported 32 million outstanding shares when it announced its fourth quarter results earlier this month.</p>
</text>
